From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Veloce PDFium Patches <veloce-pdfium@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 14:31:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Veloce: add bounded disjoint stroke batching

Reduce normal-stroke DrawPath dispatches only for adjacent path nodes with
identical paint and matrix state whose conservative device bounds are
separated by at least one pixel. Keep clip, fill, blend, state, overlap,
capacity, and RenderPlan segment boundaries hard.

Use a fixed-size 256-entry batch with a 16384-point cap, retain cancellation
discard semantics, and export batching telemetry through RenderPlan.
---
